---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StartConversation from '../components/StartConversation.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Servare Opus takes responsibility for complex, ambiguous operational work for physician-owned healthcare practices and founder-led companies — not just task management."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Servare Opus</h1>
      <p>Executive support for the work that doesn't have a clear owner yet.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>Servare Opus takes responsibility for complex, ambiguous operational work — not just task management.</p>

      <h2>How We Work</h2>
      <p>Every engagement starts the same way: understand the problem, identify the missing information and stakeholders, build the structure the situation requires, and carry it to resolution.</p>

      <h2>Who We Serve</h2>
      <p>Healthcare practices — Physician-owned practices navigating clinical systems, credentialing, and regulatory complexity.</p>
      <p>Founder-led companies — Leaders who need the research, vendor decisions, and reporting that keep slipping down the priority list, handled.</p>

      <h2>Discretion</h2>
      <p>This work touches sensitive financial, employee, and business information. Every engagement is handled with the confidentiality that requires.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <StartConversation />
</Layout>
